      "sourceTextSha256": "b7bb144f7d2ffb7a9373eae63dcb61adb74310269ed891e34ffc150199c10f70",
      "text": "South from Paramaribo, past forest giants and villages, to the river port of Atjoni and a canoe trip up the Upper Suriname River to a lodge among the rapids. After a light buffet lunch, explore the jungle and enjoy a “natural massage” in the rapids; in the evening, look for caimans under a starry sky. All meals and non-alcoholic drinks included.",
